2. `quadForm_rankOne`: Quadratic form of a rank-one matrix.
3. `quadForm_sum`: Linearity of the quadratic form.
4. `rayleighQ_rankone_sum_le`: Bound for the Rayleigh quotient of a sum of rank-one matrices.
